    /// <summary>首帧渲染后把树形数据折叠成「仅顶层」，让树形结构一目了然；表格行未就绪时下一帧重试。</summary>
    private bool treeCollapsedOnce = false;
    private bool deptCollapsedOnce = false;
    protected override void OnAfterRender(bool firstRender)
    {
        base.OnAfterRender(firstRender);
        if (!treeCollapsedOnce && treeTable != null && treeTable.CollapseAllTree())
        {
            treeCollapsedOnce = true;
        }
        if (!deptCollapsedOnce && deptTable != null && deptTable.CollapseAllTree())
        {
            deptCollapsedOnce = true;
            // 折叠完成后刷新本页（工具栏的「当前页 / 本页可见行数」依赖 deptTable 实时值）
            StateHasChanged();
        }
    }

    // ===== ⑫ 本轮新增 EP 能力接线演示 =====

    /// <summary>⑫ 演示用独立数据，避免污染其它 demo 的共享 Mock。</summary>
    private ElTable wireTable;
    private List<Product> wireRows = MockData.ProductsLarge.Take(8).ToList();
    private string wireLayout = "";
    private bool wireHideHeader = false;
    private string wireCellMsg = "（点击任意单元格 → 触发 CellClick）";
    private List<string> wireFilterValues = new List<string>();

    /// <summary>⑫ 最近一次 FilterChange 来自哪一列（条件式面板与选项列表共用同一个事件，回显要分得开）。</summary>
    private string wireFilterProp;

    /// <summary>⑫ 表格真实显示的行数：以组件读数为准，避免回显自己算一套和屏幕对不上。</summary>
    private int WireDisplayRowCount => wireTable?.VisibleRowCount ?? wireRows.Count;
    private HashSet<object> wireExpandedKeys = new HashSet<object>();

    /// <summary>⑫ CellClick 回显：载荷为 (Row, Column, RowIndex, ColumnIndex) 元组。</summary>
    private void OnWireCellClick((object Row, TableHeader Column, int RowIndex, int ColumnIndex) e)
    {
        var id = e.Row is Product p ? p.Id : 0;
        wireCellMsg = $"CellClick → 第{e.RowIndex}行/第{e.ColumnIndex}列 列「{e.Column?.Text}」 行Id={id}";
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    /// <summary>⑫ FilterChange 回显：载荷为 (Prop, Values) 元组；记录选中值用于下方命中行回显。</summary>
    private void OnWireFilterChange((string Prop, object[] Values) e)
    {
        wireFilterProp = e.Prop;
        wireFilterValues = e.Values?.Select(v => v?.ToString() ?? string.Empty)
                              .Where(s => !string.IsNullOrEmpty(s)).ToList()
                          ?? new List<string>();
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    /// <summary>⑫ ExpandChange 回显：载荷为当前展开行键集合；记录以便下方「展开内容区」渲染。</summary>
    private void OnWireExpandChange(HashSet<object> e)
    {
        wireExpandedKeys = e ?? new HashSet<object>();
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    /// <summary>⑫ 展开全部：把尚未展开的行串行展开（逐行 await，避免并发 toggle 竞态），最终 ExpandChange 给出完整快照。</summary>
    private async Task WireExpandAll()
    {
        if (wireTable == null) return;
        foreach (var r in wireRows)
        {
            if (!wireTable.ExpandRowKeys.Contains(r))
            {
                await wireTable.ToggleRowExpandAsync(r);
            }
        }
    }

    /// <summary>⑫ 折叠全部：把已展开的行串行收起。</summary>
    private async Task WireCollapseAll()
    {
        if (wireTable == null) return;
        foreach (var r in wireRows)
        {
            if (wireTable.ExpandRowKeys.Contains(r))
            {
                await wireTable.ToggleRowExpandAsync(r);
            }
        }
    }

    /// <summary>⑫ FilterChange 命中行（供 Demo 回显）：未筛选显示全部，否则按选中类别匹配。</summary>
    private List<Product> WireFilteredRows
        => wireFilterValues.Count == 0
            ? wireRows
            : wireRows.Where(r => wireFilterValues.Contains(r.Category)).ToList();

    /// <summary>⑫ 类别列筛选项（Filters）：值为 Category 字符串，配合 FilterMethod 精确匹配。</summary>
    private List<TableFilterOption> wireCategoryFilters = new List<TableFilterOption>
